From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tene11 <tene11@localhost>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 07:51:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make the Cleanroom texts easier to translate

- Texts outside a QObject class use their own translation context,
  "Cleanroom", instead of the generic "QObject", so translators see
  them together.
- Don't translate " or " as a fragment to join Java versions; list the
  numbers instead.
- Add translator comments where placeholders or short words need context.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019uQWuKsUBWZSDQz2wK6kp5
